    "summary": "Spend 2 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 **HERETIC ASTARTES TERMINATOR**, **OBLITERATORS** or **MUTILATORS** unit of yours that at least 1 of those attacks targets.\n\nUntil the turn ends, reduce the Damage characteristic of each attack allocated to 1 of your unit's models by 1. You cannot use this Stratagem and [Empyric Dislocation](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.warpstrike-champions.empyric-dislocation) on the same unit in 1 phase.",
